.TH HOPASH-START 1 2026-08-01 "Hopash RS 0.1.0" "Hopash RS User Commands"
.SH NAME
hopash\-start \- Start the background Supervisor and wait until it is ready
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBhopash start\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Start the background Supervisor and wait until it is ready
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Emit a versioned JSON document or NDJSON stream
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
